                <pb facs="0280" n="200" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg200"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-18"><hi rendition="#italic">July 18,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that greatly modified conditions for the restoration of
                    Tientsin have been accepted by the Chinese Government, and that the transfer
                    will take place in a month.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
